### AI catalog (platform + user key modes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List user AI credentials (BYOK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Connect personal OpenAI key (no platform credits charged when used)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "openai",
  "apiKey": "sk-your-personal-key",
  "label": "Personal OpenAI",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Execute with platform credits
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-ai-openai

{
  "provider": "openai",
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "operation": "CHAT",
  "input": {
    "messages": [
      { "role": "user", "content": "Give a short local test response." }
    ]
  }
}

### Execute with user key (BYOK — no credit charge)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-ai-byok

{
  "provider": "openai",
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "operation": "CHAT",
  "credentialId": "{{credentialId}}",
  "input": {
    "messages": [
      { "role": "user", "content": "Give a short local test response." }
    ]
  }
}

### Execute mock AI request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-ai

{
  "provider": "mock",
  "model": "mock-1",
  "operation": "CHAT",
  "input": {
    "prompt": "Give a short local test response."
  }
}

### AI history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests?limit=25&provider=mock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### AI request detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests/{{aiRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel a queued request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests/{{aiRequestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete credential
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: mock provider failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-ai-failure

{
  "provider": "mock",
  "model": "mock-1",
  "operation": "CHAT",
  "input": { "simulateFailure": true }
}
